{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/c7d51c41ca24475608dfeb9a46af4b33.avif?t=1749682268\" width=610 height=220 /></span>\u25a0 Join the campaign to liberate the nation of Aldin! Engage in countless hours of decisive tactical challenges and shape the fate of the rebellion!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/760f97533e52be0de46095c9b908006e.poster.avif?t=1749682268\" width=610 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/760f97533e52be0de46095c9b908006e.webm?t=1749682268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Unleash \u201cBurst Techs\u201d to enhance your abilities, and utilize them at opportune moments to shift the battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Strategically manipulate both allies and enemy positions, to dominate key points of engagement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/53e4cd94e67848a17cb86a773c6517eb.poster.avif?t=1749682268\" width=610 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/53e4cd94e67848a17cb86a773c6517eb.webm?t=1749682268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Explore a variety of maps, gather resources, and experience events in a JRPG-inspired free-roaming mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Encounter diverse NPCs, trade, and embark on exciting quests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/9880b2de42e1a189c8623b094612124a.poster.avif?t=1749682268\" width=610 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/9880b2de42e1a189c8623b094612124a.webm?t=1749682268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Navigate intricate character arcs, manage complex relationships, and make pivotal decisions that will shape the Resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Build your parties and customize their skill sets to create the synergy required to overcome a wide range of victory conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 With over 40 jobs, and countless skill combinations, customize your characters for limitless strategic possibilities! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/51484ff241f4f411412dfcce7437275b.poster.avif?t=1749682268\" width=610 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127730/extras/51484ff241f4f411412dfcce7437275b.webm?t=1749682268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Travel through a multitude of regions, each with unique maps and environmental conditions that challenge your adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Manage resources and upgrades in the Returners' encampment to bolster your forces, support allies, and expand your influence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2127730?t=1749682268","background_raw":"h